    <li><a href="/bmr-calculator/">BMR calculator</a> — uses Mifflin-St Jeor, the modern standard</li>
    <li><a href="/tdee-calculator/">TDEE calculator</a> — calculates maintenance calories accurately</li>
    <li><a href="/resources/harris-benedict-equation/">Harris-Benedict Equation</a> — full historical context and formulas</li>
